        "sid": "HAB 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwimana hami hinatalatalilaŋa, nukwimana hakaposhi, nukutalatala nimoni chuma chakahoshayi nanami, nimunakaakula namatopi ami natopekeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋakula nindi, Sonekaku chimwenu, wuchimwekeshi hanyikanda chalumbuluka, kulonda wukuchitaŋa ayi lufuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chimwenu ichi chichidi kanda, chakumwaka wakutoŋola dehi, chidi nakunyakala chishiki kunsa, hichakatwambaku. Hela chikulabajala, chichiŋilili, muloŋa chakenza chalala, hichakalabaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, muchima windi wadivwimba dehi, hiwoloka mukachi kinduku. Mukwakuloŋa wakahandila kukwitiya kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, nivinyu nawa adimbekaŋa antu chatama, himuntu wadivuna, wakashakamaŋa kwitala dindi, watoheshaŋa lwisu lwindi neyi kaluŋa, wudi neyi kufwa nawa, hatweshaŋa kwikutaku, wadikuŋwilaŋa nyuza yejima, wadilumbikilaŋa antu akumatuŋa ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa ejima hiyakumutila chishimuku? Hiyakumutila chishimu chakumuseha nachuku? Akumwila nawu, Yayo, muntu wavulishaŋa yuma yambala yawakwawu! Kushika nikumwakanyi? Muntu waditwikaŋa chiteli chatupopu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akakudya chatama hiyakakunyamukila chakukukasumwishaku? Awa akakubindaŋesha hiyakahinduka namutuluku? Kudi wena hiwakekala neyi yuma yakupupapupaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu chiwunapupapupi nyuza yayivulu, nineyi akakupupa nawa kudi antu amumatuŋa anashalashali; namuloŋa wamashi awantu, nayamadombu yiwunakoŋi niituŋa, nimukala, niantu ejima ashakamamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, owu muntu wahetelaŋa kunŋalanyi yatama kulonda eŋgi mwitala dindi, ashi chisakala chindi hewulu hahalehi, kulonda kupuluka kuŊovu jyuma yatama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu chiwunafumishuhu antu amatuŋa amavulu, wunakwati mpùŋa yakusawisha mutaŋa weyi, wunavulumuni chakuditamisha eyi aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa malola akakaloka mumbaŋu, ninyalachi yasokawu nachu yakaakula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, muntu wukutuŋa mukala namashi awantu, wukukolesha mukala nakuheŋa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, antu amumatuŋa chakabakenaŋawu kesi, ninyuza chadizeyeshelaŋawu yuma yamukunkulwayi, hichinafumi kudi Yehova wamazazaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hanu heseki hakenzala nakwiluka kwakwiluka kulema kwaYehova, neyi meji chabutaŋawu kaluŋalwiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, muntu wukumwinka mukwawu walwa, wawejelamu dehi niwulembi weyi, hiwukumushetesha nawa, kulonda wutali wusonyi wawu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi watelela kulema hikukwinzala nsonyi. Nwaku nineyi nawa, wikali neyi chidima. Luŋasa lwakuchikasa chaYehova chachidiilu lwakanyeŋumuka, lwakashika kudeyi, nsonyi yatama yakekala hakulema kweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa yamadombu yiwakoŋeli Lebanoni yakakushikena eyi aweni, nikujilumuna kuwajilumwini anyama kwakakufwisha mutentu; muloŋa wamashi awantu wunapwekeshi, nayamadombu yiwunakoŋi niituŋa nimukala niantu ejima ashakamamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukishi wakusoŋa wanasoŋuwu kudi mukwakusoŋa, hela mukishi wakusuŋununa wawuleji wakutwamba, wakwashaŋa muntu ŋahi, mwaka mukwakuwumba, chakuwumbayi mukishi wakahoshaŋa, akuhweleli chuma chanawumbiyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, muntu wukwila kamutondu, nindi, Hinduka! Wukwila ilola dakahoshaŋa, nindi, Nyamuka! Chumichi chikuleja muntu kwaamu? Talenu, achila mika tuhu wuru nasiliva, mukachi himudi muuya hela wantuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Yehova wudi mutembeli yindi yajila. Iseki dejima dimweni zo-o kumesu indi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
